  "text": "Hello all — I'd like to set up next week's CSE455 staff meeting.\n\nMy free windows next week are short: Mon 10:00–10:30 and 14:00–14:30, Tue 11:00–11:30 and 15:00–15:30, Wed 10:00–10:30 and 13:00–13:30. Thursday and Friday are full.\n\nCould we take Wed 13:00–13:30? If that doesn't work for you, send me your availability and I'll fit the meeting around it.\n\n— Prof. Alvarez",
